# 低频词汇 List09
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023恋练有词
# 描述: 低频词汇List09核心词汇

{{correlate}}{/ˈkɒrəleɪt/}{相关；关联}{Research shows that exercise correlates with better mental health.}}
{{correspondent}}{/ˌkɒrɪˈspɒndənt/}{记者；通信者}{The foreign correspondent reported from the conflict zone.}}
{{corridor}}{/ˈkɒrɪdɔːr/}{走廊；通道}{The offices are connected by a long corridor.}}
{{corrupt}}{/kəˈrʌpt/}{腐败的；堕落的}{The corrupt official was arrested for embezzlement.}}
{{costume}}{/ˈkɒstjuːm/}{服装；戏装}{Everyone wore elaborate costumes to the Halloween party.}}
{{counsel}}{/ˈkaʊnsl/}{建议；律师}{She sought financial counsel before making the investment.}}
{{counter}}{/ˈkaʊntər/}{柜台；反击}{The government took steps to counter the economic slowdown.}}
{{counterpart}}{/ˈkaʊntəpɑːt/}{对应的人或物}{The British prime minister met with her German counterpart.}}
{{coupon}}{/ˈkuːpɒn/}{优惠券；息票}{She used a coupon to get 15% off her purchase.}}
{{courtesy}}{/ˈkɜːtəsi/}{礼貌；好意}{He held the door open as a courtesy to the elderly woman.}}
{{coverage}}{/ˈkʌvərɪdʒ/}{报道；覆盖范围}{The media provided extensive coverage of the election.}}
{{crack}}{/kræk/}{裂缝；破裂}{A crack appeared in the wall after the earthquake.}}
{{craft}}{/krɑːft/}{工艺；手艺}{The traditional craft of pottery has been practiced for centuries.}}
{{credential}}{/krɪˈdenʃl/}{资格证书；资质}{The job requires specific credentials and experience.}}
{{crew}}{/kruː/}{全体船员；工作人员}{The film crew set up equipment for the shoot.}}
{{critique}}{/krɪˈtiːk/}{评论；批评}{The professor offered a thoughtful critique of the paper.}}
{{crude}}{/kruːd/}{粗糙的；原油}{The country exports crude oil to several nations.}}
{{crush}}{/krʌʃ/}{压碎；镇压}{The machine can crush rocks into gravel.}}
{{crystal}}{/ˈkrɪstl/}{水晶；晶体}{The chandelier was adorned with hanging crystals.}}
{{cuisine}}{/kwɪˈziːn/}{烹饪；菜肴}{French cuisine is renowned worldwide for its sophistication.}}
{{cult}}{/kʌlt/}{崇拜；邪教}{The cult leader was arrested for fraud.}}
{{cumulative}}{/ˈkjuːmjələtɪv/}{累积的；渐增的}{The cumulative effect of pollution is devastating.}}
{{curb}}{/kɜːb/}{抑制；路缘}{The government introduced measures to curb inflation.}}
{{curriculum}}{/kəˈrɪkjələm/}{课程；课程表}{The curriculum was updated to include digital literacy.}}
{{custody}}{/ˈkʌstədi/}{监护；拘留}{The mother was awarded custody of the children.}}
{{cynical}}{/ˈsɪnɪkl/}{愤世嫉俗的；怀疑的}{He became cynical about politics after years of disappointment.}}
{{dawn}}{/dɔːn/}{黎明；开端}{The dawn of the digital age transformed communication.}}
{{deadline}}{/ˈdedlaɪn/}{截止日期}{The deadline for submissions is next Friday.}}
{{debate}}{/dɪˈbeɪt/}{辩论；讨论}{The candidates debated the issues on live television.}}
{{decade}}{/ˈdekeɪd/}{十年}{The technology has evolved dramatically over the past decade.}}
